# Development dependencies: build-only tools, analysis scripts and tests, on top
# of the runtime set. Hand-edited; requirements-dev.txt is GENERATED from it
# (see requirements.in for the compile commands).
#
# Set up a development environment with both locks:
#   uv pip sync requirements.txt requirements-dev.txt

# Keeps every package shared with the runtime at the runtime lock's version.
-c requirements.txt

